# What prettier does not govern.
#
# Anything listed here is either generated, copied out verbatim, or owned by a toolchain that
# is not ours. Formatting it does not make the repository more consistent — it makes the next
# merge worse.

# Generated or installed.
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
**/coverage/**
**/.wireit/**
**/test-results/**
**/playwright-report/**

# Scratch git worktrees, not part of the repository.
.claude/**

# Templates the scaffolder copies out; they are not part of this codebase.
packages/create-app/src/*/static/**
packages/create-app/src/*/templates/**

# Upstream's experiment, governed by upstream's toolchain: pnpm, biome, TypeScript 6 beta.
# This entry is not housekeeping — it repairs something that already cost us. Our prettier
# reformatted 15 of its `.ts` files as they arrived in the sync of 2 August 2026, purely
# swapping quote style; each of those files now conflicts on every change upstream makes to
# them, for no benefit at all. `pnpm-lock.yaml` is generated by a package manager we do not
# even use here.
packages/labs/**
